                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f0af250e-ab9c-3179-9105-669cbda71d97",
                        "entry_id": "9124b332-be61-3a47-994c-9026cef1134a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A brand name for a psychostimulant combination drug containing four salts of amphetamine, used in the treatment of conditions such as ADHD and narcolepsy and often misused as a recreational drug."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e23915e0-436c-4dda-af20-b7b8bfe770e3",
                                "sense_id": "f0af250e-ab9c-3179-9105-669cbda71d97",
                                "text": "Pop a couple of Adderalls."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36e19570-8c48-47b2-807f-2050d6d75f6e",
                                "sense_id": "f0af250e-ab9c-3179-9105-669cbda71d97",
                                "text": "Doctors and the media have helped to create the belief that the best way to treat ADD/ADHD is with stimulant medications, such as Ritalin or Adderall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2067487-d06d-4e96-9c22-65f5e78ef668",
                                "sense_id": "f0af250e-ab9c-3179-9105-669cbda71d97",
                                "text": "A few years back I tried that “Harvard drug,” Adderall, which gives you the power to read for twelve hours straight and internalize everything you read—and it was a total disaster."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "12986a25-a4c9-4115-a758-89c7633971ac",
                                "sense_id": "f0af250e-ab9c-3179-9105-669cbda71d97",
                                "text": "He was a teenager too, a student at an elite private boys school whose family’s western New York home was known as a party house where teens gathered to consume liquor, marijuana and Adderall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83bd6bcd-bc5b-4155-abfe-e6661e8ba748",
                                "sense_id": "f0af250e-ab9c-3179-9105-669cbda71d97",
                                "text": "Adderall made me high, yes, but what I found far more appealing was that it gave me a few hours of feeling less depressed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0dca337-c0de-4bfa-a702-7f52c7604163",
                                "sense_id": "f0af250e-ab9c-3179-9105-669cbda71d97",
                                "text": "His regular medication box contained pills bearing Adderall markings alongside other substances, according to sources with the Times who have seen photographs of the container."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
